---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactSection from '../components/ContactSection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Study in Switzerland - Ved Bhatawadekar">
  <header class="page-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">▦</span> Ved Bhatawadekar</a>
    <nav><a href="/">Profile</a><a class="active" href="/consult">Consult</a><a href="/blog">Blog</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Study in Switzerland</p>
    <h1>Move forward with more clarity.</h1>
    <div class="intro">
      <p>I know how confusing the application process can feel when you are trying to figure it out on your own. When I applied, I did not want answers handed to me - but I did wish I had someone to talk to who had just been through it.</p>
      <p>If you are applying to Switzerland or Europe for your master’s and feel unsure about universities, your SOP, or the visa process, I would be happy to share what worked for me.</p>
      <p>I will not hand you a template or write your application. We can work through your thinking, identify blind spots, and help you move forward with more clarity.</p>
    </div>
    <section>
      <p class="eyebrow">What I can help with</p>
      <ul><li>Shortlisting universities based on your goals </li><li>Feedback on your SOP, CV and application strategy</li><li>Understanding the visa process</li><li>Timelines, doubts and decision-making</li></ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <p class="eyebrow">A short conversation</p>
      <h2>30-45 minutes, one-on-one and informal    </h2>
      <p>There are no slides and no pressure. This is currently free for students who are serious and thoughtful about their journey.</p>
      <a class="cta" href="https://calendly.com/ved_bhatawadekar/1-on-1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Book a free session ↗</a>
    </section>
    <section>
      <p class="eyebrow">Questions</p>
      <dl><dt>Can you guarantee admission?</dt><dd>No. I can help you present your story honestly and thoughtfully.</dd><dt>Do you write SOPs?</dt><dd>No. I can help shape your thinking, but the words should be yours.</dd><dt>Can we meet in Zurich?</dt><dd>If I am free and around, yes - happy to meet in person.</dd></dl>
    </section>
  </main>
  <ContactSection />
  <footer>© 2026 Ved Bhatawadekar <span>Study · Strategy · Clarity</span></footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header, .page-shell, footer { width:min(1080px,calc(100% - 3rem)); margin:auto; }
  .page-header { min-height:74px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; font:500 1rem 'Playfair Display',serif; } .mark { display:grid; place-items:center; width:1.8rem; height:1.8rem; color:var(--paper); background:var(--green); font-family:Arial,sans-serif; } nav { display:flex; gap:1.1rem; } nav a { color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none; font:.75rem 'DM Mono',monospace; text-transform:uppercase; } nav .active { color:var(--green); }
  .page-shell { padding:clamp(4rem,10vw,7rem) 0 5rem; } .eyebrow { margin:0; color:var(--gold); font:500 .75rem 'DM Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  h1,h2 { color:var(--green); font-family:'Playfair Display',serif; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:-.04em; } h1 { max-width:40rem; margin:.8rem 0 2rem; font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,5.6rem); line-height:.95; } h2 { margin:.7rem 0 1rem; font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem); line-height:1.05; }
  p { max-width:43rem; font-size:1.08rem; } .intro { border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:2.5rem; } section { padding:2.8rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); } ul { max-width:38rem; padding-left:1.2rem; } li { margin:.7rem 0; } .cta { display:inline-block; margin-top:1rem; padding:.8rem 1rem; background:var(--green); color:var(--paper); text-decoration:none; font:500 .8rem 'DM Mono',monospace; } dl { margin:1rem 0 0; } dt { margin-top:1.2rem; color:var(--green); font-weight:600; } dd { margin:.3rem 0; color:var(--muted); } footer { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; padding:0 0 2.3rem; color:var(--muted); font:.72rem 'DM Mono',monospace; text-transform:uppercase; }
  @media (max-width:700px) { .page-header,.page-shell,footer { width:min(100% - 2rem,1080px); } .page-header { padding:.8rem 0; align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; } nav { flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.7rem 1rem; } }
</style>
